  {
   "id": "makis-adventure-188863@major-2025-04-20",
   "gameId": "makis-adventure-188863",
   "displayName": "Big News & Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-04-20T18:18:24.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Im SUPER excited to announce that Makis Adventure will launch on Consoles THIS YEAR!!! This was my big dream as a gamedeveloper ever since the game launched... More information will be shared soon. Together with eastasiasoft, we will bring Maki into new oceans to swim in :)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This Update changed a lot of backend stuff that you wont see directly: I switched to Unity 6 which was recommended and I had to fix a lot of bugs that came up after the Upgrade, but Im happy to finally say that all problems were solved and the game will run smoother and more bug-free now. I rewrote and improved a LOT of the game-code and also switched to JSON files for the Save-Files. That means that you can now see all the clear values and look through the save-files now easier ^^",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "That sadly also means that the earlier save-files might not work anymore, but they wont be deleted, so you will still have them on your PC!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Have a great day!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Best regards,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Mateo (ZoroArts)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
