  {
   "id": "makis-adventure-188863@major-2025-02-20",
   "gameId": "makis-adventure-188863",
   "displayName": "Content Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-02-20T22:15:24.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello and welcome to the biggest Makis Adventure Update yet!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I spent the last months working on this Update every single day and I hope that you will like the changes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Here are the News",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "-> The 3D Hubworld has Textures now and I tried to improve the overall look.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-> A new minigame: Waterball can be found on the Hubworld",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-> I added my dream feature: A Level Editor to the game! Im a big fan of Mario Maker and developing a Level Editor was my big goal and dream for Makis Adventure. I spent 5 months building this feature and you can build levels and dungeons with all the elements from the main-game. I even added extra objects such as snow, ice, canons, chainsaws and other elements for you to make cool levels.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-> I remade and improved a LOT of the UIs in the game",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-> More Settings are now accessible for you",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-> There were some problems with the Steam-Achievements, which should be fixed now",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-> I rewrote the whole Save-System and I now use JSON files. Your previous save-data will not be deleted but sadly I have to admit that it is not working anymore for the new Update. Im sorry for that!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-> Auto-Scrolling on UI is now possible. If you hold the joystick in a specific direction now, it keeps scrolling.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-> You can now see the needed score to get gold, silver or bronce in the Minigame Tutorial UI.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-> I added a black outline to all the characters, enemies and interactible objects to make them stand out.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-> A LOT of Bugs were fixed and some smaller changes were made",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I hope that you will enjoy the new changes and wish you a fantastic day!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
